		<outline text="BA inflight food baggie :-D">
			<outline text=" Geoff Garside 	

ggarside@gmail.com &lt;mailto:ggarside@gmail.com&gt; to adam
	 More options	  Aug 28 (1 day ago)
Hi Adam,
I just listened to your August 24th podcast and thought I would share
with your my experience of my British Airways flight from Moscow. Due
to the strike of Gate Gourmet there was to be no food on the flight.
However while the plane was being refueled and so on the stewards and
stewardesses had gone out and purchased some food for the passengers.
Each passenger was then given a bag of food and so on as they boarded
the plane. In the bag was an apple, banana, can of pepsi, sandwich,
mars bar. Personally I thought this was the best selection of food I
had ever had on any flight anywhere, it was also much nicer to be able
to eat as and when I felt like it rather than in the slice of time
when they have put the food in front of me.


Happy birthday for you and your daughter,


Geoff"/>
			</outline>
